# Lightmine Field, T:Mode$ AttackersDeclared -> DB$ DealDamage | Defined$
# TriggeredAttackers | NumDmg$ X (X = Count$Valid Creature.attacking). The
# trigger records the declared attackers (AbilityKey.Attackers,
# TriggerAttackersDeclared.java:91), so each of the two attacking lions takes 2
# and dies; the lion that stayed home is untouched.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1,2
declareattackers
resolvestack
